+
+  vdd-csiphy5-0p9-supply:
+    description:
+      Phandle to a 0.9V regulator supply to CSIPHY5 core block.
+
+  vdd-csiphy5-1p2-supply:
+    description:
+      Phandle to a 1.2V regulator supply to CSIPHY5 pll block.
